---
import DiscordIcon from '../../public/assets/icons/DiscordIcon.astro';
---

<section class="community-cta design-container">
  <div class="community-panel">
    <div class="community-copy" data-reveal>
      <span class="design-eyebrow">Entre edición y edición</span>
      <h2>Nos seguimos viendo<br /><em>en el servidor.</em></h2>
      <p>
        Para buscar equipo, compartir lo que juegas y no perderte la próxima
        quedada.
      </p>
      <a href="https://discord.gg/FWW9wKZjav" class="design-button"
        >Entra al Discord de la ULP <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="community-server" data-reveal>
      <div class="server-icon" aria-hidden="true"><DiscordIcon /></div>
      <span class="server-label">COMUNIDAD ULP</span>
      <strong>La partida continúa.</strong>
      <div class="server-topics">
        <span>Encuentra equipo</span><span>Comparte partidas</span><span
          >Sigue las novedades</span>
      </div>
      <span class="server-corner" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .community-cta {
    padding-block: 55px;
  }
  .community-panel {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 0.7fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 55px;
    padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 65px);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at top right, #176574, transparent 70%), #004465;
    color: #f5f0e6;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .community-copy .design-eyebrow {
    opacity: 0.65;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(35px, 5.3vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }
  em {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .community-copy > p {
    max-width: 390px;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.85;
    opacity: 0.75;
    margin-top: 25px;
  }
  .design-button {
    margin-top: 28px;
    background: #f5f0e6;
    color: #004465;
    border-color: #f5f0e6;
  }
  .community-server {
    position: relative;
    padding: 30px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(245 240 230 / 0.2);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: rgb(245 240 230 / 0.045);
    transform: rotate(3deg);
  }
  .server-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: #f5f0e6;
    color: #004465;
  }
  .server-icon :global(svg) {
    width: 45px;
    height: 45px;
  }
  .server-label {
    display: block;
    font:
      8px ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .community-server > strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 650;
    margin-block: 14px 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .server-topics {
    display: grid;
    gap: 9px;
  }
  .server-topics span {
    border: 1px solid rgb(245 240 230 / 0.12);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
  }
  .server-corner {
    position: absolute;
    top: 25px;
    right: 25px;
    font-size: 30px;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
  @media (max-width: 950px) {
    .community-panel {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    .community-server {
      max-width: 400px;
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .community-cta {
      padding-block: 35px;
    }
    .community-panel {
      gap: 30px;
    }
    .community-server {
      transform: none;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .server-icon {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
